WEBVTT

00:44:59.163 --> 00:45:03.871
You said that being a memoirist is about
learning how to re-enter previous

00:45:03.871 --> 00:45:06.496
versions of yourself. Yeah.

00:45:06.663 --> 00:45:11.663
How do you go back into that previous
version while still maintaining

00:45:12.079 --> 00:45:13.079
who you are?

00:45:14.038 --> 00:45:16.204
Well, you know, you enter
the magic of writing,

00:45:16.621 --> 00:45:20.246
that's that's what's so cool about it
is so what I mean by that is this is

00:45:20.246 --> 00:45:22.288
the only way for me to write.

00:45:23.121 --> 00:45:26.079
About my real heartbreak over

00:45:26.329 --> 00:45:34.663
the decision to end my first marriage is
to abandon the woman I am now who says,